Pass CPATH from the shell to the compiler when building gem5.

SCons builds with a clean environment and only imports the variables listed
in use_vars. Without CPATH, Python.h cannot find crypt.h, which comes from
libxcrypt in the micromamba environment. This is the only change to gem5.

Applies to: gem5/site_scons/site_tools/default.py (artefact tag AEV3)

